    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6654" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cappădox</span></b> ,
		ŏcis, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καππάδοξ</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A river in Cappadocia</i>, <i>from
				which this province is said to have derived its name</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 6, 3, 3,
				§ 9</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A Cappadocian;</i> v. Cappadocia, II. A.</div>
